# The sentence spec.Sentence writes for testdata/templates/ask-for-a-repro-on-quiet-bugs.json. Rewrite with
# go test ./internal/autopilot/spec -run TestSentenceGolden -update

When an issue assigned to you goes quiet for 14 days, if the labels include bug and the labels don't include needs-repro, comment your "Needs repro" reply and add the needs-repro label. At most 2 tries per issue.
